<!-- SECTION 1: DEMOGRAPHIC OVERVIEW -->
<div class="section" id="sec1">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-number">1</div>
    <h2>Student Demographic Overview</h2>
  </div>
  <p>The dataset comprises <strong>1,000 students</strong> from eight divisions of Bangladesh, spanning the typical HSC age range of 15&ndash;18. The sample is well-balanced across most key dimensions, providing a robust foundation for comparative analysis.</p>

  <div class="stat-grid">
    <div class="stat-box"><div class="val">510</div><div class="lbl">Female</div></div>
    <div class="stat-box"><div class="val">490</div><div class="lbl">Male</div></div>
    <div class="stat-box"><div class="val">524</div><div class="lbl">Private School</div></div>
    <div class="stat-box"><div class="val">476</div><div class="lbl">Public School</div></div>
